# ECONOMY REGISTRY: kill rewards. Read at build time by bolt (ctf_econ:kill, ctf_econ:config).
# The other money values (start, max, round wins, loss bonus, objectives, teamkill) are in
# ctf_econ:config.
# Cheap / hard weapons pay more per kill than strong ones.

# The weapon in the killer's main hand (custom_data wpn:"<wpn>"), checked in this order.
#   name - the reason in the chat: "+$40 kill (golden sword)"; money - score #kill.<wpn> econ
